      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TREACHEROUS DAN (5) led and couldn't hold race rival SRIRACHA off when a hot favourite here last week but that was off a freshen so it may have improved him. Has put together a string of wins and placings. Hails from the powerful Emma Stewart yard so should be peaking tonight. Tough draw for HEZ SO ROYAL (10) but he is ultra consistent with a string of top-two results here including wins over this distance in his last two appearances. Just needs even luck to be a big threat. SRIRACHA (1) was drawn on the back row when midfield at Port Pirie on Wednesday but won twice in a row here prior, coming from this barrier to beat TREACHEROUS DAN two back. Could do it again. STEAM MACHINE (7) was only 2m off HEZ SO ROYAL last start and won at this circuit and distance three back. Exotic player.",
